From a46fba3672d394662185d5a5f26dd10186381813 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ben Walker <ben@nvidia.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Aug 2024 15:42:40 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 01/21] sock: Remove zero copy APIs

Nothing currently uses these. We plan to introduce a different approach
for zero copy rx in the patches following this one.

As part of this we need to shift the buffer pool down into the io_uring
sock module. It is the only module that will need a pool like this.

Change-Id: Icbcc9a895a920851e20a92996e6ceded8bde804f
Signed-off-by: Ben Walker <ben@nvidia.com>
